Shady Alleyway
- Panhandle | [=""]
	set {temp_money} = range(10,51).pick_random()
	set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
	You made {temp_money} money
	Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
- Buy Contraband Goods
	- Antenna - $XXX
		do Inventory.add_item("Antenna")
	- Storage Unit Key - $XXX
		do Inventory.add_item("Storage_Unit_Key")
	- Fake ID - $XXX
		do Inventory.add_item("Fake_ID")
- Break Into Abandoned Cars (Requires Crowbar)
	do Inventory.add_item("Crowbar")
	if {Inventory.has_item("Crowbar")}:
		set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
		if {random_chance} <= 50:
			You found a catalytic converter
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
		else:
			You found nothing
- Sleep Here
	if {Inventory.has_item("Gun")}:
		You may spend 1 bullet to lower the risk
		- Spend 1 bullet
		- Do nothing
	else:
		set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
		if {random_chance} <= 50:
			You sleep in the filthy alleyway. Fortunately your sleep is undisturbed and your valuables are untouched.
		elif {random_chance} > 50 and {random_chance} < 80:
			Things go awry
		else:
			do Global.change_resolve(-100)
- End the day
	{RandomEvents.roll_event()}